Benefits of having sessions:

1. Cannot be manipulated by client
2. HttpOnly cookies prevent XSS attacks
3. Server-side validation
4. Automatic session management
5. Centralized logout
6.Works across tabs


Express Core Concepts:
Concept	Role
App	Main server instance
Router	Groups routes by module
Route	Defines URL endpoints
Controller	Handles logic for routes
Middleware	Runs before/after routes
Model	Handles data schema and DB
Service	Contains business logic
Request/Response	Communicate between client/server
Error Handler	Centralized error catching

Middleware types:
Logging
Authentication
Parsing
Security
CORS
